mermaid.structure:
flowchart TD
  Save[Record save] --> Entry{Start entry conditions met?}
  Entry -->|No| Skip[Interview does not start]
  Entry -->|Yes| Meet{Only when updated to meet conditions?}
  Meet -->|Would retrip same true values| Skip
  Meet -->|Newly meets or create| Type{before-save or after-save}
  Type -->|before-save| Assign[Assignment on triggering record in this save]
  Type -->|after-save| Work[Related Get/Create/Update/Delete]
  Work --> Recurse{Updated triggering record again?}
  Recurse -->|Yes| Save
  Assign --> Explorer[Flow Trigger Explorer order 1 to 2000]

mermaid.decision:
flowchart TD
  Need[Record-triggered work] --> Q1{Only fields on the triggering record?}
  Q1 -->|Yes| Before[before-save Fast Field Updates]
  Q1 -->|Related records| After[after-save plus entry conditions]
  After --> Q2{Must not run on every edit?}
  Q2 -->|Yes| Entry[Start conditions plus updated-to-meet when the field must change into the band]
  After --> Q3{Flow updates the triggering record?}
  Q3 -->|Yes| Risk[Recursion risk: prefer before-save or a guard field / updated-to-meet]
  Need --> Q4{Several Flows on one object?}
  Q4 -->|Yes| Order[Flow Trigger Explorer trigger order 1-2000; one job per Flow]
